  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Talk about your qualities",
   "texto": [
    "In an interview you can ask about your **kvalifikasjoner** (qualifications), your experience and how you work with other people. **Fleksibel** means you can adapt; **nøyaktig**, you work carefully."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Third-person holders",
   "texto": [
    "**Hans** means «its» of it; **hennes**, «its» of it; **deres**, «its» of them or of you. Unlike **min/mi/mitt/mine**, these forms do not change with the gender or the number of the possessed thing: **hans CV**, **hennes erfaring**, **deres arbeidsplass**."
   ]
  },
